# 🔍 GitHub Profile Viewer  
A clean, fast, and modern web app that allows users to search for any GitHub profile and instantly view key information such as name, bio, avatar, followers, public repositories, and more — all powered by the GitHub Users API.

This project features a responsive UI, elegant dark theme, and localStorage caching for seamless offline access.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 🔎 **Search any GitHub user** by username  
- ⚡ **Real-time fetch** from GitHub REST API  
- 💾 **Auto-save last fetched profile** using `localStorage`  
- 🎨 **Modern dark UI** inspired by GitHub’s design  
- 📱 Fully **responsive** on mobile & desktop  
- 🧩 Simple and clean code structure (HTML, CSS, JS)  
- 🛟 Includes fallback offline data loader (development mode)

